  "description": "**PLEASE REGISTER TO INSPECT**<br/>Please register your details by selecting BOOK INSPECTION and you will be INSTANTLY informed of any updates, changes or cancellations for your property appointment.<br/><br/>This home may look modest from the outside, but step inside and you’ll be pleasantly surprised by the space, layout, and thoughtful design on offer. Perfectly positioned opposite a lovely park and open space, and just meters from shops, transport and local conveniences, this is easy-care living at its best.<br/><br/>Features include:<br/>• Master bedroom with built-in robe and ensuite<br/>• Two additional bedrooms with built-in robes<br/>• Study or optional 4th bedroom<br/>• Modern kitchen with stone benchtops, gas cooktop, electric oven, rangehood, dishwasher & ample storage<br/>• Open plan living and dining area<br/>• Main bathroom with separate shower and bath<br/>• Laundry with large linen cupboard<br/>• Fully enclosed, low-maintenance paved courtyard<br/>• Double lock-up garage with shopper’s entry<br/>• Additional on-street parking<br/><br/>Details:<br/>• Pets considered on application.<br/>• 12 Months is preferred. 6 Months is also acceptable.<br/><br/>Location:<br/>• Directly opposite green parklands<br/>• 350m to Butler Train Station<br/>• 450m to Butler Central Shopping Centre (Coles, cafés & restaurants)<br/>• 1.2km to East Butler Primary School<br/>• 1.6km to Butler College<br/>• Close to local gyms, childcare, and beautiful Jindalee Beach (approx. 4km away)<br/><br/><br/>DISCLAIMER: This information is provided for general purposes only, based on details from third parties, including the Seller and local authorities, and may be subject to change. No warranty or representation is made regarding its accuracy. Interested parties should not rely on it and should conduct their own independent investigations. Photos are for illustrative purposes only (if applicable).<br/>",
